            "detailed_description": "Join poker's most outspoken players for a hand of Telltale Texas Hold'em, the card game stacked high with personality. Quips will fly, chips will fall, and you may just end up rolling in the aisles.<br>This is your chance to play in a poker tournament against four characters of such lethal absurdity, you'll either die laughing or die trying. Test your skills as you answer life's toughest questions...<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Can you outsmart Harry Weinhead, the wily businessman and student of the game?<br></li><li>Can you humiliate Boris Krinkle, the tough guy with a heart of pure lead?<br></li><li>Can you groove with Theodore Dudebrough, slacker extraordinaire and just plain cool dude?<br></li><li>Can you even understand Grandma Shaky, the eccentric old coot who may be more dangerous than she looks?</li></ul>Even if you've never played Texas Hold'em before, you'll learn everything you need to know, and you'll laugh learning it!",
